      "instance_name": "person",
      "label": "a woman",
      "description": "A woman with light brown hair, wearing a flowing white garment, appears to be floating or dancing in the air. Her posture is graceful and ethereal, with one arm extended and the other holding the fabric of her dress. She is the central focus of the image, positioned against a backdrop of clouds and falling white petals, evoking an angelic or divine presence.",
